    {
      "sort_order": 1,
      "title_en": "Thawan's Busy Day",
      "body_en": "The sun came up. Thawan opened his eyes and yawned. He jumped out of bed and ran to the kitchen. He ate a bowl of rice and drank a glass of orange juice.\n\nAt school, Thawan read his English book and wrote three sentences. In art class, he drew a picture of a big blue elephant.\n\nAt recess, all the children played together. Thawan jumped over a puddle. He threw the ball to Ollie, and Ollie caught it in his wing.\n\nAfter school, Bua fell down in the yard. Thawan helped her stand up. She laughed and said, \"Thank you, Thawan!\"\n\nAt bedtime, Thawan closed his eyes and slept."
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 2,
      "title_en": "The Kids Weather Channel",
      "body_en": "On Saturday it rained all morning. Nong Fah could not go outside, so she made a weather station out of a big box.\n\n\"Welcome to Kids News!\" she said. \"Today it is rainy and cloudy.\"\n\nThen the wind began to blow. Leaves flew past the window. \"Now it is windy!\" said Thawan.\n\nSuddenly there was thunder, and lightning flashed in the sky.\n\nIn the afternoon the storm stopped. The sun came out and the sky was blue. Nong Fah looked out of the window and saw a beautiful rainbow."
    },
    {
      "sort_order": 3,
      "title_en": "Whose Toy Is It?",
      "body_en": "Nong Fah and Thawan both reached for the same toy dinosaur.\n\n\"That is mine!\" said Thawan. \"No, it is mine!\" said Nong Fah. They pulled and pulled.\n\nOllie flew down between them. \"Whose toy is it, really?\"\n\nNong Fah thought for a moment. \"It is hers. I took it from Bua's room this morning.\"\n\n\"Then it is not my toy,\" said Thawan, \"and it is not your toy. It is her toy.\"\n\nThey went to find Bua. \"We are sorry, Bua. This is your dinosaur.\"\n\nBua smiled. \"Thank you! You can play with it with me.\""
    }
  ],
